{"success":false,"message":"Lỗi hệ thống: When allowCredentials is true, allowedOrigins cannot contain the special value \"*\" since that cannot be set on the \"Access-Control-Allow-Origin\" response header. To allow credentials to a set of origins, list them explicitly or consider using \"allowedOriginPatterns\" instead.","data":null,"timestamp":"2026-07-27T17:45:01.43382"}